OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy today  
OL,6,Fwith the odd sunny break in the        
OL,7,Fmorning. It will feel cold with a      
OL,8,Fgentle easterly breeze and             
OL,9,Ftemperatures slightly below average    
OL,10,Ffor the time of year.                  
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will turn much wetter and  
OL,13,Fbreezier tonight as rain arrives and   
OL,14,Fsweeps across the region through the   
OL,15,Fmorning. Temperatures recover to give  
OL,16,Fa milder feel, especially towards      
OL,17,FCornwall.                              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
