OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CFriday:FAlthough winds tend to ease on 
OL,6,FFriday morning, it will still be       
OL,7,Frather wet and murky throughout with   
OL,8,Fheavy rain and widespread low cloud. A 
OL,9,Fless cold day than Thursday.           
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThe    
OL,12,Fweekend will begin rather unsettled    
OL,13,Fwith heavy rain and gusty winds on     
OL,14,FSaturday. On Sunday and Monday, it     
OL,15,Fwill likely be brighter and drier,     
OL,16,Ffeel milder with light winds.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
